{"unit_id":"xia-sc__dsh-decision#card-zh","repo":"xia-sc/dsh-decision","commit":"1ac5c5ae4aa818bf817e95754a929258b34fa878","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-decision（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：把 Decision 3.0 多模态决策模型接入 DSH，让 Agent 对文本、图片或视频提出带选项的问题并获得校准概率。它注册 decision_ask 和 decision_info 两个工具，并在 Web 界面提供决策设置页与概率条结果卡片。主要功能包括选项判断、是非判断、候选评分、图片区域定位，以及查看模型、用量和状态。适合需要将分类、比较或视觉判断交给决策模型的 DSH 用户。使用前需要配置 DECISION_API_KEY；默认模型为 vllm-sr/d3-flash。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1173-1200","index.js:1294-1308","client.js:1365-1385"]}
{"unit_id":"xia-sc__dsh-decision#card-en","repo":"xia-sc/dsh-decision","commit":"1ac5c5ae4aa818bf817e95754a929258b34fa878","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-decision connects Decision 3.0 models to DSH. Its tools return probabilities for text, image, and video questions: choices, yes/no, scores, and image boxes. A Web settings page manages the API key and model; a result card shows probability bars. Configure DECISION_API_KEY.","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1173-1200","index.js:1294-1308","client.js:1365-1385"]}
