{"unit_id":"xia-sc__dsh-decision#feature-1","repo":"xia-sc/dsh-decision","commit":"1ac5c5ae4aa818bf817e95754a929258b34fa878","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-decision 的功能「多类型决策提问」：Agent 可提交 choice、是非、评分或图片框选问题，并在一次调用中附带文本、图片或视频输入。工具返回各问题的答案、概率和置信度。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1173-1200"]}
{"unit_id":"xia-sc__dsh-decision#feature-2","repo":"xia-sc/dsh-decision","commit":"1ac5c5ae4aa818bf817e95754a929258b34fa878","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-decision 的功能「模型与用量查询」：Agent 调用 decision_info 并选择 models、usage 或 status，可查看可用模型及限制、已配置密钥的配额和近期用量，或模型实时状态。","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:1294-1308"]}
{"unit_id":"xia-sc__dsh-decision#feature-3","repo":"xia-sc/dsh-decision","commit":"1ac5c5ae4aa818bf817e95754a929258b34fa878","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-decision 的功能「Web 设置和概率卡片」：Web 设置页用于配置 API Key 与默认模型；工具调用结果可在对话中显示概率条卡片，呈现决策答案。","source":"generated","evidence":["client.js:1365-1385"]}
{"unit_id":"xia-sc__dsh-decision#caveat-1","repo":"xia-sc/dsh-decision","commit":"1ac5c5ae4aa818bf817e95754a929258b34fa878","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-decision 使用前须知：问题及提供的媒体会发送至 Decision 服务；调用需要 API Key。（见 index.js:26、index.js:206-227）","source":"generated","evidence":["index.js:26","index.js:206-227","index.js:1173-1200"]}
